      "content": "Interesting. So you're saying the opposition is basically just defending the status quo. But what about the actual fiscal math? A lot of economists argue that the tax burden required to fund a UBI large enough to actually matter would crush the very innovation we need to solve the AI transition. Is there any legitimate economic framework where UBI works without causing a massive capital flight or a complete collapse of the tax base?",
